==Overview==
The Strider Rocket is an enemy that appears in [[Nightmare Mode]]. It has a medium amount of health, and moves at an average speed. 

Strider Rocket Toilet's ability is that it can shoot rockets at units to stun them.
==Appearance==
The strider rocket toilet is a toilet with 3 legs, similar to a tripod and having similarties to [[Turret Spider Toilet]].
==Health==
On its first appearance, it is seen to have 1130000 hp.
==Waves==

* Nightmare - Wave 32

==Abilities==
*Rocket Shoot: Shoots rockets at units, stunning them.
==Strategy==
*TBA
==Trivia==
*It is based of the [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Laser_Strider_Skibidi_Toilet#Upgraded_Laser_Strider_Skibidi_Toilet Laser Strider Skibidi Toilet].
